776
00:58:27,420 --> 00:58:30,080
So this is something
stronger than convergence.

777
00:58:33,180 --> 00:58:35,500
And for many things--

778
00:58:35,500 --> 00:58:38,540
for many, although not all--

779
00:58:38,540 --> 00:58:40,340
there is a particular
test that deals

780
00:58:40,340 --> 00:58:46,780
with it where you don't have
both things or you [INAUDIBLE]

781
00:58:46,780 --> 00:58:48,060
have a stronger property.

782
00:58:48,060 --> 00:58:54,500
So for many things you
have absolute convergence.

783
00:58:54,500 --> 00:59:00,680
And so let me try to--
so absolute convergence.

784
00:59:09,100 --> 00:59:13,080
So again, you have
a series here.

785
00:59:17,220 --> 00:59:21,400
This series here is said to be
