786
00:59:21,400 --> 00:59:27,300
absolutely-- so
converge absolutely--

787
00:59:31,620 --> 00:59:38,340
if the series where you slap
absolute values on them,

788
00:59:38,340 --> 00:59:41,410
if this thing here, converge.

789
00:59:51,400 --> 00:59:54,020
So we say that this
here converge absolutely

790
00:59:54,020 --> 00:59:55,700
if this here converge.

791
00:59:55,700 --> 01:00:04,220
Now, so I claim that
absolute convergence

792
01:00:04,220 --> 01:00:06,000
