793
01:00:16,740 --> 01:00:32,288
So absolute convergence
implies convergence.

794
01:00:32,288 --> 01:00:34,100
So this is a theorem.

795
01:00:38,420 --> 01:00:40,860
But it's not the
other way around.

796
01:00:40,860 --> 01:00:44,140
So if you have
what's called the--

797
01:00:44,140 --> 01:00:46,980
so here, an example.

798
01:00:46,980 --> 01:00:49,900
And we haven't yet proved
