799
01:00:49,900 --> 01:00:52,050
but we'll do that in
some later lecture.

800
01:00:59,180 --> 01:01:03,460
So here's an example.

801
01:01:03,460 --> 01:01:07,140
If you're looking at
the series minus 1

802
01:01:07,140 --> 01:01:11,300
to the power n divided
by n, n equal to 1

803
01:01:11,300 --> 01:01:17,340
to infinity, let's say you see
