805
01:01:19,860 --> 01:01:25,280
This here series is also
kind of like a famous series.

806
01:01:25,280 --> 01:01:29,590
It's called the alternating
harmonic series.

807
01:01:34,780 --> 01:01:35,960
And it's alternating.

808
01:01:35,960 --> 01:01:39,560
Alternating means that the
sign of it is alternating.

809
01:01:39,560 --> 01:01:43,020
So the sign of
this an element, it

810
01:01:43,020 --> 01:01:47,540
keeps changing from a-- in this
