01:15:24,950 --> 01:15:26,070
They're all non-negative.

983
01:15:26,070 --> 01:15:34,490
And the first one is the
largest, so 1 over 2n squared,

984
01:15:34,490 --> 01:15:38,530
like this, right.

985
01:15:38,530 --> 01:15:41,870
And so you see that
this thing here is--

986
01:15:41,870 --> 01:15:45,490
so now we can fill
in the assumption.

987
01:15:45,490 --> 01:15:50,770
We are assuming that this
here was less than this.

988
01:15:50,770 --> 01:16:00,110
This is sum from i equal to 0 to
n minus 1 of 1/2 to the power i.

989
01:16:05,210 --> 01:16:11,210
And this thing here, but
the square kills that one

990
01:16:11,210 --> 01:16:15,050
and you're still
left with 1 over 2n.

991
01:16:15,050 --> 01:16:19,250
But you see, this is, of
course, exactly the next one

992
01:16:19,250 --> 01:16:20,150
in the series.

993
01:16:20,150 --> 01:16:29,970
So this is i equal to 0 to n
of 1/2 to the power i, again.

994
01:16:29,970 --> 01:16:34,242
And that's, indeed, this is
like the induction step, right?

995
01:16:34,242 --> 01:16:35,950
This is what's called
the induction step.

996
01:16:35,950 --> 01:16:38,530
